Comment: 0,0:04:49.93,0:04:54.77,CN_UP,,0,0,0,,{\fs30}Earlier this morning, the UN announced that the democratic revolution army,
Comment: 0,0:04:49.93,0:04:54.77,CN_UP,,0,0,0,,{\fs36}今晨 联合国宣称广泛分布于联合国各处的民主革命军组织
Comment: 0,0:04:54.89,0:04:59.32,CN_UP,,0,0,0,,{\fs30}an organization based in various parts of Asia, had been subjugated.
Comment: 0,0:04:54.89,0:04:59.32,CN_UP,,0,0,0,,{\fs36}民主革命军 已被成功压制
Comment: 0,0:04:59.44,0:05:02.74,CN_UP,,0,0,0,,{\fs30}The Un Chairman Brain Jackson reported that, a young man
Comment: 0,0:04:59.44,0:05:02.74,CN_UP,,0,0,0,,{\fs36}联合国主席布莱恩·杰克森报告称 一位年轻男性
Comment: 0,0:05:02.74,0:05:07.32,CN_UP,,0,0,0,,{\fs36}被认为是事件的元凶 成员已全部无伤逮捕
Comment: 0,0:05:07.66,0:05:11.41,CN_UP,,0,0,0,,{\fs36}今后 我们将继续搜索革命军的残存部队
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,====补充BGM ED====君の文字
